Brotli normative data
=====================

src/brotli_dictionary.inc contains the static dictionary, word transformations,
and context lookup tables specified by RFC 7932, Appendices A/B and Section 7.1.
Source: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7932.txt
No compressor/decompressor implementation was imported from another library.

