XZ BCJ filter reference
=======================
The size-preserving PowerPC, ARM, ARM-Thumb, SPARC and ARM64 bit transforms
were implemented with reference to the XZ format and its official 0BSD
simple filters (Igor Pavlov, Lasse Collin, Jia Tan):
https://github.com/tukaani-project/xz/tree/master/src/liblzma/simple
No liblzma binary or compression implementation is linked or invoked.

